  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 97d36a54e6f6a4c8fa5e054a8bdbd8ed, type: 3}
  m_Name: coworkerDialgoue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: Oh hey! Perfect timing. I was just thinking about looking for you.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Actually, to be honest, I\u2019ve been thinking about a lot of things
      today. Too many things, really."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "You ever have one of those days where you start doing something, then
      you remember three other things you were supposed to do, and suddenly you\u2019re
      not doing any of them?"
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Yeah\u2026 that\u2019s been my entire morning."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Anyway, I was trying to sort out those files the boss asked about.
      You know, the ones from last week? Or maybe it was the week before\u2026 time
      kind of blends together around here."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "But then the computer froze. Not crashed, just\u2026 froze. Like it
      decided it needed a moment to think about life."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: So I restarted it. Twice.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Then I realized the problem wasn\u2019t the computer."
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: It was me.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: I forgot to plug in the network cable.
    replyOptions: []
    replyBranches: []
    loopQuestion: 0
  - speakerName: coworker
    portrait: {fileID: 0}
    voiceClip: {fileID: 0}
    content: "Which is honestly embarrassing, but at least now everything\u2019s
      working again."
    replyOptions:
    - Can we get to the point?
    - What does this have to do with my task?
